  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soil Values West Africa (2023-2033)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme works on integrated soil fertility management in Burkina Faso, Mali, Niger and northern Nigeria and aims to achieve sustainable management of soil fertility and contribute to ecologically sustainable improvement in food security and increased resilience of small-scale food producers in the Sahel. The programme supports ongoing and future local, national and regional projects, programmes and policies, through the introduction and reinforcement of soil fertility management.</narrative>
  </description>
